graph TD
  A[ESP32 loop reads HDC302x] -->|JSON temperature and humidity| B[serial_unified_listener.py]
  B --> C{Message type}
  C -->|TOUCHED or NOT_TOUCHED| D[insert_touch_event]
  C -->|Sensor JSON with device_id| E[parse_sensor_data]
